{"id":426,"name":"drifblim","speciesId":426,"dex":426,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["ghost","flying"],"stats":{"hp":150,"attack":80,"defense":44,"special-attack":90,"special-defense":54,"speed":80},"abilities":[{"name":"aftermath","hidden":false},{"name":"unburden","hidden":false},{"name":"flare-boost","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":150,"baseExp":174,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/426.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/426.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/426.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/426.ogg","genus":"Blimp Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It’s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift."},{"version":"black-2","text":"They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination."},{"version":"y","text":"It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."},{"version":"sun","text":"There was once an incident in which a man took a trip riding a Drifblim, only to go missing."},{"version":"moon","text":"Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"There’s a rumor that if you catch a Drifblim floating on the wind at dusk, you’ll be carried away to the afterlife."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"The raw material for the gas inside its body is souls. When its body starts to deflate, it’s thought to carry away people and Pokémon."},{"version":"sword","text":"Some say this Pokémon is a collection of souls burdened with regrets, silently drifting through the dusk."},{"version":"shield","text":"It grabs people and Pokémon and carries them off somewhere. Where do they go? Nobody knows."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"It drifts along at dusk, perfectly silent. Its transient, melancholy aspect touches some people deeply—every so often, one will come upon a song or poem devoted to Drifblim."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["indeterminate"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"drifloon","speciesId":425,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28"],"species":"drifblim","speciesId":426,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":426,"name":"drifblim","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/426.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":16,"learn":[[8,"lv",1],[8,"lv",11],[9,"lv",1],[9,"lv",11],[10,"lv",1],[10,"lv",11],[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",11],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",8],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",8],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",8],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",8],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",8],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":19,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":20,"learn":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":60,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":85,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm"